                                "sense_id": "8e53027c-4c7c-32d9-bf55-223737f2c4be",
                                "text": "There were extraordinary scenes of chaos and anger in the House of Commons overnight as opposition MPs staged a protest against the suspension of parliament for five weeks – a prorogation that the Speaker of the House said represented “an act of executive fiat”."
